      "template": "<div lang=\"en\" style=\"width:100%; min-height:100vh; background:#0a0a09; font-family:'Cormorant Garamond', serif; box-sizing:border-box;\">\n\n  \n\n  \n\n  <main data-pagefind-meta=\"url:/en/collection/colombia/banco-de-la-republica-half-peso-oro-specimen/\" id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\" data-screen-label=\"Bank of the Republic — Half Gold Peso (Specimen)\" style=\"max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:56px 24px 80px; outline:none;\">\n\n    <a href=\"/en/collection/colombia/\" style=\"display:inline-block; color:#e7ddc4; text-decoration:none; font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:24px;\">&larr; Colombia catalog</a>\n\n    <div style=\"background:#d8d2cd; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.08); border-radius:3px; padding:clamp(28px,4vw,64px); box-shadow:0 30px 70px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);\">\n\n      <div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:center;\">\n\n        <div style=\"text-align:center; max-width:720px; margin:0 auto 40px;\">\n          <span style=\"display:block; font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.22em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; margin-bottom:14px;\">Bogotá, Colombia &middot; January 18, 1948</span>\n\n          <h1 style=\"font-family:'Montenegrin Gothic One', serif; font-weight:400; font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px); line-height:1.08; letter-spacing:0.01em; color:#1c1a15; margin:0 0 12px;\">The Bank of the Republic</h1>\n\n          <p style=\"font-size:clamp(19px,2vw,23px); font-style:italic; color:#4a4331; margin:0;\">Medio Peso Oro (Specimen) &mdash; known as &ldquo;Lleritas&rdquo;</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:560px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin:0 auto 56px;\">\n          <button data-zoom-trigger=\"note-1\"\n            aria-label=\"Enlarge image of the banknote\"\n            style=\"all:unset; display:block; width:100%; position:relative; cursor:zoom-in;\"\n          >\n            <picture>\n              <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-la-republica-medio-peso-oro-1948-specimen.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n              <img\n                src=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-la-republica-medio-peso-oro-1948-specimen.jpg\"\n                alt=\"Banknote especimen de Half Gold Peso de The Bank of the Republic, Colombia, fechado January 18, 1948, obverse arriba con retrato joven de perfil militar y reverse abajo con el escudo de Colombia\"\n                width=\"564\"\n                height=\"558\"\n                loading=\"eager\"\n                decoding=\"async\"\n                style=\"display:block; width:100%; height:auto; border:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\"\n              />\n            </picture>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:22px; right:22px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.82); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; padding:8px 14px; border-radius:999px;\">\n              <span style=\"width:6px; height:6px; background:#d8d2cd; transform:rotate(45deg);\"></span>Enlarge</span>\n          </button>\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:#5c4e33; text-align:center; font-style:italic;\">Obverse (top) and reverse (bottom) &mdash; Notofilia.com Collection</span>\n<div style=\"display:flex; flex-direction:column;\">\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Country</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Republic of Colombia</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Issuing Entity</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">The Bank of the Republic, Bogotá</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Denomination</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Half Gold Peso</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Date</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">January 18, 1948, Bogotá</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Series</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Series C, number 00000</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Legal Basis</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Law 33 of 1938, Decree 122 of 1948</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Obverse</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Portrait of Antonio Nariño, red &ldquo;SPECIMEN&rdquo; overprint, black ornamentation</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Reverse</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Coat of arms of Colombia (condor, oval and Phrygian cap) in the center</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Printer</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">American Bank Note Company</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Condition</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Uncirculated gem, with two cancellation perforations</span>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"display:grid; grid-template-columns:200px 1fr; gap:6px 20px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); border-bottom:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12);\">\n              <span style=\"font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.1em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33;\">Reference</span>\n              <span style=\"font-size:19px; color:#221f19;\">Pick P-384s (fractional variant)</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n\n          \n            <div\n              role=\"dialog\"\n              aria-modal=\"true\"\n              aria-label=\"Enlarged banknote\"\n             \n             data-zoom-dialog=\"note-1\" hidden class=\"catalog-zoom-dialog\">\n              <button\n                data-zoom-close\n                aria-label=\"Close\"\n                style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; right:28px; background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.4); color:#d8d2cd; font-size:22px; line-height:1; width:44px; height:44px; border-radius:50%; cursor:pointer;\"\n              >&times;</button>\n\n              <div style=\"position:absolute; top:24px; left:28px; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; background:rgba(10,10,9,0.5); border:1px solid rgba(231,222,201,0.25); border-radius:999px; padding:6px;\">\n                <button type=\"button\" data-zoom-out\n                  disabled=\"true\"\n                  aria-label=\"Zoom out\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&minus;</button>\n                <span data-zoom-percent style=\"min-width:56px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#e7ddc4; letter-spacing:0.05em;\">100%</span>\n                <button\n                  disabled=\"false\"\n                  data-zoom-in aria-label=\"Zoom in\"\n                  style=\"width:38px; height:38px; border-radius:50%; border:none; background:transparent; color:#d8d2cd; font-size:20px; cursor:pointer;\"\n                >&#43;</button>\n              </div>\n\n              <div\n                style=\"overflow:hidden; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; touch-action:none;\"\n              >\n                <picture>\n                  <source srcset=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-la-republica-medio-peso-oro-1948-specimen.webp\" type=\"image/webp\" />\n                  <img data-zoom-image\n                    src=\"/uploads/colombia-banco-de-la-republica-medio-peso-oro-1948-specimen.jpg\"\n                    alt=\"Banknote especimen de Half Gold Peso, enlarged view\"\n                    draggable=\"false\"\n                    style=\"display:block; max-width:100vw; max-height:100vh; width:100vw; height:100vh; object-fit:contain; transform:; cursor:zoom-in; user-select:none;\"\n                  />\n                </picture>\n              </div>\n\n              <span style=\"position:absolute; bottom:16px; left:50%; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:14px; letter-spacing:0.06em; color:#b7ab8a; font-style:italic; pointer-events:none;\">Drag to move &middot; Mouse wheel to zoom</span>\n            </div>\n          \n        </div>\n\n        <div style=\"width:100%; max-width:760px;\">\n          \n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:44px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">A Postwar Fractional Note</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0 0 12px;\">Issued on January 18, 1948, this Medio Peso Gold specimen corresponds to the last section of Colombian fractional denominations linked to the gold standard, prior to the full decimalization of the currency. Printed by the American Bank Note Company, it exhibits refined engraving and very elaborate ornamental borders for a piece of such a low face value.</p>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\"><strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Obverse:</strong>portrait of a young military man &mdash;identified with<a href=\"/en/collection/colombia/profile-antonio-narino/\">Antonio Nariño</a>&mdash; in the center, flanked by large figures &ldquo;&frac12;&rdquo; and &ldquo;1/2&rdquo;, with the legend &ldquo;REPUBLIC OF COLOMBIA &middot; WILL PAY THE BEARER THE SUM OF HALF A PESO ORO&rdquo;.<strong style=\"color:#1c1a15;\">Reverse:</strong>the coat of arms of Colombia in the center, with the condor, the Phrygian cap and plant motifs, framed in a highly crafted border.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:36px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:15px; letter-spacing:0.2em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 14px; font-style:normal;\">&ldquo;Lleritas&rdquo;</h2>\n            <p style=\"font-size:19px; line-height:1.65; color:#332e22; margin:0;\">Among Colombian collectors, this half peso circulates under the nickname &ldquo;Lleritas&rdquo;, a popular term for low-denomination peso fractions from the first half of the 20th century. As a specimen, it bears the red overprint &ldquo;SPECIMEN&rdquo; on both sides and numbering in zeros (00000), in addition to the cancellation perforations typical of the printer's archival specimens.</p>\n          </section>\n\n          <section style=\"margin-top:32px; border-top:1px solid rgba(10,10,9,0.12); padding-top:24px;\">\n            <h2 style=\"font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.18em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#5c4e33; font-weight:600; margin:0 0 12px; font-style:normal;\">Sources</h2>\n            <ul style=\"margin:0; padding:0 0 0 20px; font-size:15px; line-height:1.7; color:#5c4e33; font-style:italic;\">\n              <li>Pick, Albert.<em>Standard Catalog of World Paper Money.</em></li>\n              <li>Hernández, Pedro Pablo.<em>Coins and Banknotes of Colombia.</em></li>\n              <li>Restrepo, Jorge Emilio.<em>Coins of Colombia.</em></li>\n              <li>Heritage Auctions —<a href=\"https://www.ha.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">ha.com<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n              <li>Numista —<a href=\"https://en.numista.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">numista.com<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n              <li>Bank of the Republic —<a href=\"https://www.banrep.gov.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#6b521f;\">banrep.gov.co<span style=\"font-style:italic; font-weight:400;\">(opens in a new tab)</span></a></li>\n            </ul>\n          </section>\n\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  \n\n</div>",
